<title>SINGAPORE: IPCO says order book exceeds S$280 mln.</title>
<headline>IPCO says order book exceeds S$280 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPCO International Ltd said on Friday it has an existing order book of over Singapore $280 million worth of projects.</p>
<p>In a note accompanying its 1996 results, the infrastructure development company said based on its existing order book and good prospects for other new projects, it expected its performance in 1997 to be satisfactory.</p>
<p>The company announced a 13 percent fall in net profit to Singapore $6.74 million for the year ended June 30 1996.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
